# Brand component error sentences.
error-brand-asset-fetch-failed = A logo or picture in the brand pack couldn't be downloaded after three tries. Check your connection and try again.
error-brand-asset-hash-mismatch = A picture in the brand pack isn't the one it should be, so it wasn't used.
error-brand-asset-invalid = A picture in the brand pack is too large, the wrong kind of file, or unsafe, so it wasn't used.
error-brand-contrast-failed = Some brand colours are too close together to read easily. Choose colours with more contrast.
error-brand-fixed-token = The brand pack tries to change a safety colour that can't be changed.
error-brand-id-invalid = The brand's name isn't valid. Choose another name.
error-brand-locale-duplicate = The brand pack lists the same language twice. Remove one.
error-brand-refusal-reason-mismatch = The brand pack's record is inconsistent: a refusal has no reason, or a reason has no refusal.
error-brand-strings-missing = The brand pack is missing wording, or a language lacks its legal text. Add it and try again.
error-brand-string-invalid = A piece of brand wording is too long or too short. Adjust it and try again.
error-brand-superseded = A newer brand pack arrived before this one was checked, so this one was dropped.
error-brand-tokens-invalid = The brand colours or styles aren't valid, a required colour is missing, or there are too many. Fix them and try again.
error-brand-url-invalid = A link in the brand pack must start with https and be under 2048 characters long.
error-brand-version-invalid = The brand pack's version must be three numbers separated by dots, such as 1.2.3.
